# A deterministic ambient tour: feed the fish, move virtual wall time through
# sunset and night, briefly pause monotonic motion, and exercise manual lighting.
at 0.2s caption top 3s RTC SETS THE LIGHT - PIT KEEPS THE HABITAT MOVING
at 0.6s move -135 -95 during 0.3s
at 1s mouse 0 0 1
at 1.1s mouse 0 0 0

at 2s rtc 2026-07-30T19:42:00
at 2.2s caption bottom 2s RTC JUMP TO SUNSET CHANGES THE WATER PALETTE
at 3.2s rtc 2026-07-30T23:15:00
at 3.4s caption bottom 2s NIGHT ARRIVES WITHOUT RESETTING PIT MOTION

at 4.2s key P down
at 4.3s key P up
at 4.7s key P down
at 4.8s key P up

at 5.2s key L down
at 5.3s key L up
at 5.8s key F down
at 5.9s key F up

at 7s key ESC down
at 7.1s key ESC up
